  "title": "Easy Slow Cooker Chicken Curry with Potatoes and Coconut Milk",
  "description": "This easy, mild, slow cooker chicken curry with potatoes and coconut milk recipe uses chicken breasts, coconut milk, and bell pepper, with minimal prep.",
